Summer is here, and so are a few seasonal risks. A few quick tips to keep you=
r home safe:

- Keep grills at least 10 feet from your house and deck railings.
- Leave fireworks to the professionals, and keep a hose nearby if you do cele=
brate at home.
- Clean out gutters before summer storms roll in.
- Test your sump pump and make sure it drains away from your foundation.

